kaisa ye dardnaak hai manzar furaat par<br>
<br>
zakhmi pada huwa hai ghazamfar furaat par <br>
kham hogayi kamar meri aakar furaat par<br>
<br>
hai dard ka manzar ke dilawar gaya mara <br>
shane kata ke sogaya hyder ka dulaara <br>
roro ke bain karte the sarwar furaat par<br>
<br>
jis dam mahaaze jang me ye sher lada tha <br>
zalim ko bas ek waar se hi dher kiya tha <br>
kehte the ahle shar ke hai hyder furaat par<br>
<br>
jab tegh lagi shanou pe abbas e jari ke <br>
seene se lagaaya tabhi parcham ko nabi ke <br>
thanda huwa alam wahi'n girkar furaat par<br>
<br>
har ek gira hai ghodey se hathou ke sahaare <br>
abbas mera khud ko bhala kaise sambhaale <br>
baazu katake gir pada dilbar furaat par<br>
<br>
girkar zamee'n pe ghazi yehi kehte they rokar <br>
aajaiye ab aaqa khabar lijiye aakar <br>
dhaate hain sitam mujhpe sitamgar furaat par<br>
<br>
jab tegh-e-sitam aankh se shabbir ne khencha <br>
hasrat bhari nigaah se abbas ne dekha <br>
dam tod gaya bhai wo kehkar furaat par<br>
<br>
khaime me bhala kis tarha mai chehra dikhau'n <br>
maara hai mere sher ko kistarha batau'n <br>
darta hu'n ke aajaaye na khawhar furaat par<br>
<br>
maare gaye ammu ye sakina jo sunegi <br>
kis tarha chacha se wo judayi ko sahegi <br>
doudi huwi wo aayegi rokar furaat par<br>
<br>
baazu kate jo ammu ke dekhegi sakina <br>
phir apne gham-o-ranj se wo peetegi seena <br>
marjaye na wo sadma uthakar furaat par<br>
<br>
zainab ki jo dharas thi wo baaqi na rahi ab <br>
saidaniyou'n ke sar se chhinegi rida bhi ab <br>
soti hai sabki aas ki chadar furaat par<br>
<br>
kaise ho baya'n faiz wo hangaam-e-musibat <br>
saqqa-e-haram kargaya duniya se jo rehlat <br>
sarwar bhi rorahe the tadapkar furaat par<br>
